('advanced-native-1840', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1840-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["不自在有逐步變化的線索，說話者仍未清楚解釋原因。"],"options":["說話者已證實噪音是全部感受的唯一原因。","說話者在避開活動後，才第一次感到想念熟悉飯菜。","不自在有逐步變化的線索，說話者仍未清楚解釋原因。","所有不自在都在第一刻突然出現，之後沒有改變。"]},"advanced-native-1840-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The signs appeared at different points rather than in one sudden moment.","I could trace a change in what I wanted to join over the stay.","The later withdrawal followed a smaller earlier feeling I had not yet explained.","It was a slow build-up of discomfort, from missing a meal to avoiding the evenings."],"options":["The signs appeared at different points rather than in one sudden moment.","I could trace a change in what I wanted to join over the stay.","The later withdrawal followed a smaller earlier feeling I had not yet explained.","It was a slow build-up of discomfort, from missing a meal to avoiding the evenings."]},"advanced-native-1840-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The scene establishes a slow build-up of discomfort over the preceding weeks."],"options":["Earlier gradual unease would need additional evidence from the story.","The scene establishes a slow build-up of discomfort over the preceding weeks.","The passage reports a sudden embarrassed reaction to being named."]},"advanced-native-1840-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["已經確認全部感受只來自一個原因。"],"options":["不自在是逐漸累積的。","已經確認全部感受只來自一個原因。","可再問何時出現哪些線索及仍有甚麼未知。"]},"advanced-native-1840-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It was a slow build-up of discomfort, not a judgement about everyone on the first night; I am still trying to explain the change."],"options":["I thought the later avoidance showed I had felt that way from the first evening.","I thought the gradual pattern meant we already knew exactly which person caused it.","It was a slow build-up of discomfort, not a judgement about everyone on the first night; I am still trying to explain the change."]},"advanced-native-1840-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Could you show a slow build-up of discomfort through different dinners, such as shorter replies and an earlier departure? Let the character try to explain the change rather than have the narrator assign one person all the blame.","A slow build-up of discomfort would make the ending easier to follow if we saw small changes before the refusal. I would keep those moments specific and leave room for the character’s uncertain explanation."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1841', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1841-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["朋友的缺席與未知消息，持續影響大家對重聚的感受。"],"options":["大家只擔心朋友錯過節目，並沒有因聯絡不到她而感到不安。","朋友的缺席與未知消息，持續影響大家對重聚的感受。","大家到聚會結束後，才第一次得知朋友沒有回覆消息。","朋友已解釋缺席原因，大家不再有疑問。"]},"advanced-native-1841-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The unanswered question cast a shadow over the whole experience.","We were still worried about why nobody had heard from our friend.","Her unexplained absence remained in our thoughts throughout the gathering.","The lively moments did not remove the concern that had come with the missing news."],"options":["The unanswered question cast a shadow over the whole experience.","We were still worried about why nobody had heard from our friend.","Her unexplained absence remained in our thoughts throughout the gathering.","The lively moments did not remove the concern that had come with the missing news."]},"advanced-native-1841-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["This account does not show the brief seating problem casting a shadow over the whole experience."],"options":["The pleasant later moments were only expectations before the performance began.","This account does not show the brief seating problem casting a shadow over the whole experience.","The initial irritation has been described as a concern that continued throughout the performance."]},"advanced-native-1841-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["所有愉快時刻都不曾發生。"],"options":["所有愉快時刻都不曾發生。","仍可描述具體的好時刻與持續顧慮並存。","某種不安影響了整體感受。"]},"advanced-native-1841-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It cast a shadow over the whole experience because the concern stayed with us, even while we enjoyed seeing one another."],"options":["I would take the laughter as evidence that nobody was still wondering about the absence.","I thought describing a shadow meant we should recount only the unanswered question and no other moments.","It cast a shadow over the whole experience because the concern stayed with us, even while we enjoyed seeing one another."]},"advanced-native-1841-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Thank you for the care in the displays, but the missing caption tablet cast a shadow over the whole experience because I kept worrying about Ada following the tour. Could you check why it was not available as promised?","I appreciated the exhibition, yet the lack of the promised captions cast a shadow over the whole experience for me as I watched Ada struggle to follow. I would welcome an explanation of what happened, without assuming it was deliberate."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1842', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1842-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["同一張桌子承擔了新增工作用途，影響原有用餐需要。"],"options":["同一張桌子承擔了新增工作用途，影響原有用餐需要。","這張桌子原本只用來工作，現在才第一次被用來吃飯。","兩人只在晚飯後工作，吃飯時間完全沒有受影響。","住所只是住得較久，沒有任何用途或需要的改變。"]},"advanced-native-1842-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The difficulty comes from changed daily needs rather than the length of time we have lived here.","Our life has outgrown this space because the dinner table now has to accommodate both people’s work as well as meals.","The same table has competing uses we did not previously need to manage.","We no longer have a clear place to eat together while the work is laid out."],"options":["The difficulty comes from changed daily needs rather than the length of time we have lived here.","Our life has outgrown this space because the dinner table now has to accommodate both people’s work as well as meals.","The same table has competing uses we did not previously need to manage.","We no longer have a clear place to eat together while the work is laid out."]},"advanced-native-1842-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Life outgrows the space they are living in when the actual needs still exceed how the rooms can be used, even if the floor area is larger."],"options":["The new work and care arrangements use the room at separate times, so there is no simultaneous demand.","Life outgrows the space they are living in when the actual needs still exceed how the rooms can be used, even if the floor area is larger.","The larger floor area establishes that the competing uses of the quiet room have been resolved."]},"advanced-native-1842-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["唯一可行選擇已確定是立即搬走。"],"options":["唯一可行選擇已確定是立即搬走。","仍可先了解實際用途、時段和可商量的安排。","需要與空間使用方式可能出現落差。"]},"advanced-native-1842-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Our life has outgrown this space, but that does not change how well it served us before our working routines changed."],"options":["I thought a place that once suited us should remain suitable regardless of new uses.","I would judge the present problem only by how long we have lived here, without comparing the old and new uses.","Our life has outgrown this space, but that does not change how well it served us before our working routines changed."]},"advanced-native-1842-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Our life has outgrown this space as it is currently arranged, because the new work requires quiet time while the shared room is in use. May we discuss changing the uses of the two rooms before deciding whether a move is necessary?","We feel that our life has outgrown the space in its present form, rather than that the flat has no value to us. Could you tell us whether a different room arrangement would be permitted?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1843', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1843-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者珍惜過去的安歇感，也承認現在使用方式有變。"],"options":["說話者把安歇感只歸於較大的面積，沒有提到書本或共處日常。","人物只在回憶裝修風格，沒有提及房間裏的生活。","過去每周都沒有共處時間，安靜晚上只是未來計劃。","說話者珍惜過去的安歇感，也承認現在使用方式有變。"]},"advanced-native-1843-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The small routines made it comforting to us at that time.","Its earlier meaning is still valuable, even though our use of the rooms has changed.","It once felt like a nest, with books, lamplight and some quiet time together.","I remember a place where we could settle into familiar evenings."],"options":["The small routines made it comforting to us at that time.","Its earlier meaning is still valuable, even though our use of the rooms has changed.","It once felt like a nest, with books, lamplight and some quiet time together.","I remember a place where we could settle into familiar evenings."]},"advanced-native-1843-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Saying it once felt like a nest can preserve the comfort of family routines without denying the cold window."],"options":["Saying it once felt like a nest can preserve the comfort of family routines without denying the cold window.","The nest image establishes that every part of the room was physically comfortable in winter.","The cold window is described as the reason the family never enjoyed eating together."]},"advanced-native-1843-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["當時每項實際條件都必定完美。"],"options":["仍可同時記得缺點及珍惜的日常。","地方曾帶來安歇或熟悉感。","當時每項實際條件都必定完美。"]},"advanced-native-1843-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It once felt like a nest, and those memories can stay true even when our present needs are different."],"options":["I would evaluate the earlier evenings only by how useful the flat is for our work today.","It once felt like a nest, and those memories can stay true even when our present needs are different.","I thought a warm memory required us to keep every room in the same use."]},"advanced-native-1843-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["This house once felt like a nest to our family, especially on rainy afternoons when Grandma made tea and we gathered at the table. Its new use does not take away what those hours meant to us.","What once felt like a nest to us now has another purpose, but the album can keep the memory of those shared cups of tea. I want to remember our time there without claiming the building must remain unchanged."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1844', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1844-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["小組開始新的安排，也保留對舊項目的交代責任。"],"options":["小組已決定不再舉行任何活動，沒有下一步。","新的活動已完成，所以不再需要向原來幫手交代。","小組開始新的安排，也保留對舊項目的交代責任。","小組想原樣重做已取消的同一活動，不考慮規模改變。"]},"advanced-native-1844-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We hoped to begin something new while explaining what had happened before.","The cancellation did not have to be the end of our work together.","A new plan seemed possible, alongside the explanation we had promised.","We wanted to turn the page with a smaller event, without leaving the earlier helpers uninformed."],"options":["We hoped to begin something new while explaining what had happened before.","The cancellation did not have to be the end of our work together.","A new plan seemed possible, alongside the explanation we had promised.","We wanted to turn the page with a smaller event, without leaving the earlier helpers uninformed."]},"advanced-native-1844-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She can turn the page and still miss people from the earlier stage."],"options":["She can turn the page and still miss people from the earlier stage.","Missing an old colleague establishes that she has not begun the new role.","The new role means she should describe the earlier team as having no lasting importance."]},"advanced-native-1844-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["先前承諾及需要交代的事已自動取消。"],"options":["先前承諾及需要交代的事已自動取消。","仍可帶着學到的經驗開始下一步。","當事人想向新的階段前進。"]},"advanced-native-1844-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We can turn the page and still send the explanation; a new plan does not replace what we promised those helpers."],"options":["I would wait until the new event is over before telling the earlier helpers what happened.","I thought turning the page meant focusing only on new participants rather than replying to the original group.","We can turn the page and still send the explanation; a new plan does not replace what we promised those helpers."]},"advanced-native-1844-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I am ready to turn the page after two rewarding years as captain, and I am grateful for what we built together. I will finish the handover notes, then look forward to taking part as an ordinary member.","Turning the page means letting someone else lead while I find a new place in the club, not forgetting our shared work. Thank you for these two years; I will make sure the promised notes reach the new captain."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1845', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1845-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["訪問要再做，但仍可運用先前留下的問題與筆記。"],"options":["小組認為筆記已可直接取代錄音，所以不需要第二次訪談。","訪問要再做，但仍可運用先前留下的問題與筆記。","小組只改了檔案名稱，原錄音內容仍在。","準備第二次時，小組刻意不用先前筆記，以免再問舊問題。"]},"advanced-native-1845-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We had to start over, but the earlier questions and notes gave us a useful starting point.","The first conversation had left material we could still learn from.","Our notes helped us make the second session clearer.","Losing the audio did not mean losing every insight from the conversation."],"options":["We had to start over, but the earlier questions and notes gave us a useful starting point.","The first conversation had left material we could still learn from.","Our notes helped us make the second session clearer.","Losing the audio did not mean losing every insight from the conversation."]},"advanced-native-1845-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The author started over with the whole piece."],"options":["The author made a local correction while keeping the existing text.","The account does not describe beginning the writing process again.","The author started over with the whole piece."]},"advanced-native-1845-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["所有先前經驗都已沒有用途。"],"options":["仍需交代重做範圍，以及哪些材料可保留。","某項工作或階段要重新起步。","所有先前經驗都已沒有用途。"]},"advanced-native-1845-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We can start over with the recording and still use the notes; they help us ask better questions, rather than replace the new interview."],"options":["I would avoid looking at the notes until after the second session, even where they identify a question we missed.","I thought a new recording required us to act as though we had never heard the first conversation.","We can start over with the recording and still use the notes; they help us ask better questions, rather than replace the new interview."]},"advanced-native-1845-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I would like to start over with your costume team while bringing the sewing skills I learned in my former drama group. I know I will need to learn your routines, and I hope to keep in touch with the old team too.","Since my old group closed, I am hoping to start over in costume work with a new team. Could I help with a small sewing task first, using my earlier experience while learning how you organise the work?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1847', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1847-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["表面的椅子問題，牽涉新成員能否平等參與的核心。"],"options":["爭論只在比較椅子木材，沒有參與方式的問題。","新成員已被禁止所有討論，所以雙方不再爭論。","說話者只想增加椅子數量，沒有關心誰可加入討論。","表面的椅子問題，牽涉新成員能否平等參與的核心。"]},"advanced-native-1847-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["People were not only choosing furniture; they were deciding how newcomers would be included.","The practical detail affected whether participation felt open in the first place.","At bottom, it was about newcomers being able to join without repeated special permission.","The seating arrangement carried a larger question about access to the discussion."],"options":["People were not only choosing furniture; they were deciding how newcomers would be included.","The practical detail affected whether participation felt open in the first place.","At bottom, it was about newcomers being able to join without repeated special permission.","The seating arrangement carried a larger question about access to the discussion."]},"advanced-native-1847-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The stated timing problem gives a basis for asking what matters at bottom; the photographs alone do not establish a wish to impress."],"options":["The account says he has no difficulty with the timing of the journey home.","The stated timing problem gives a basis for asking what matters at bottom; the photographs alone do not establish a wish to impress.","The photographs are enough to identify impressing others as the fundamental reason."]},"advanced-native-1847-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["只要說了這個片語，所指核心便不需任何依據。"],"options":["說話者正在指出較根本的問題。","只要說了這個片語，所指核心便不需任何依據。","表面細節仍可幫助理解根本問題。"]},"advanced-native-1847-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["At bottom it is about participation, and the seating details matter because they help put that principle into practice."],"options":["At bottom it is about participation, and the seating details matter because they help put that principle into practice.","I would keep the general statement about welcome and leave the arrangements until after newcomers arrive.","I thought identifying a fundamental aim meant the smaller practical choices no longer contributed to it."]},"advanced-native-1847-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["At bottom, my concern is whether people at the back can read the choices, not whether the slides match my taste. Could we test one slide from those seats before deciding which changes are needed?","These design questions are, at bottom, about making the information usable for the whole room. I would like to try the projected text from the back rather than insist on every detail of my preferred layout."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1848', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1848-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者有工具知識，但仍欠日常程序與責任位置的認識。"],"options":["說話者已會一般工作流程，只是第一份訂單還未批核。","說話者熟悉訂單程序，卻不懂工具使用。","說話者有工具知識，但仍欠日常程序與責任位置的認識。","說話者不認識任何工具，也未有任何既有能力。"]},"advanced-native-1848-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I knew how to use the tools, but not how the workshop organised the work.","The missing knowledge concerned who did what and where information was kept.","My practical skills did not yet give me a route through the local procedures.","It felt like starting a chapter with the map missing because I did not know the approval and record systems."],"options":["I knew how to use the tools, but not how the workshop organised the work.","The missing knowledge concerned who did what and where information was kept.","My practical skills did not yet give me a route through the local procedures.","It felt like starting a chapter with the map missing because I did not know the approval and record systems."]},"advanced-native-1848-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["It can still feel like starting a chapter with the map missing in that specific area, even though the routine guidance is useful."],"options":["It can still feel like starting a chapter with the map missing in that specific area, even though the routine guidance is useful.","The handbook’s existence establishes that he already knows who approves the exceptions.","He has described being unable to understand the ordinary registration as well as the exceptions."]},"advanced-native-1848-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["當事人已注定無法適應，也沒有任何既有能力。"],"options":["新階段缺乏某些實際導向。","當事人已注定無法適應，也沒有任何既有能力。","可以問清缺的是資訊、聯絡人還是本地經驗。"]},"advanced-native-1848-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It still felt like starting a chapter with the map missing; knowing the tools did not tell me who approved an order here."],"options":["I thought asking where the records were kept would mean admitting I could not use the tools.","It still felt like starting a chapter with the map missing; knowing the tools did not tell me who approved an order here.","I would rely on the approval process from my previous workplace before asking whether this one differs."]},"advanced-native-1848-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Arriving here felt like starting a chapter with the map missing, especially when I did not know how to find local books and activities. Thank you for showing me once and leaving room for me to try; I can now make those arrangements myself.","What once felt like starting a chapter with the map missing now feels more manageable, as I can find the services I need myself. Thank you for going to the library with me and showing me how to borrow before letting me try on my own."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1849', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1849-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["小組已透過比較可用時數議出輪值，場地仍待確認。"],"options":["第一輪活動已完成，輪值效果也已作過檢討。","小組已透過比較可用時數議出輪值，場地仍待確認。","房間已確認所有時段，幫手的時間卻未曾比較。","小組只是把原表重印，沒有討論或得出新安排。"]},"advanced-native-1849-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We worked out a fair rota by comparing the hours people could actually offer.","Each helper’s availability gave us information to build the arrangement around.","We discussed the real hours rather than divide the sessions without asking.","The first draft came from matching the tasks with the time people said they had."],"options":["We worked out a fair rota by comparing the hours people could actually offer.","Each helper’s availability gave us information to build the arrangement around.","We discussed the real hours rather than divide the sessions without asking.","The first draft came from matching the tasks with the time people said they had."]},"advanced-native-1849-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["They have worked out a draft arrangement, but its remaining venue condition still needs confirmation."],"options":["They have worked out a draft arrangement, but its remaining venue condition still needs confirmation.","The agreed draft is a report of an event that has already run successfully.","They have not yet discussed any helper’s availability or proposed a schedule."]},"advanced-native-1849-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["辦法已在實際執行中證明完全成功。"],"options":["辦法已在實際執行中證明完全成功。","仍可需要試行、確認條件或再作調整。","已透過思考或討論找出一個辦法。"]},"advanced-native-1849-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We have worked out the rota, but let us confirm the room before telling everyone the sessions are ready to run."],"options":["We have worked out the rota, but let us confirm the room before telling everyone the sessions are ready to run.","I would send the rota as final and look for a different room only if people arrive to find this one unavailable.","I thought the helpers’ agreement was also con