('advanced-native-1850', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1850-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["敘述有先遇困難、再用具體方法改善的前後證據。"],"options":["開放時間從未改變，所有白走都只是未發生的假設。","敘述有先遇困難、再用具體方法改善的前後證據。","說話者只預測以後必改善，沒有提過已發生的轉變。","清單在搬家前已完整適用，所以一開始沒有任何困難。"]},"advanced-native-1850-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Everyday life became harder before it became easier, and the shared list helped us understand the new hours.","We began planning with the actual opening hours instead of making repeated unsuccessful trips.","The shared list gave us a way to fit the errands into the new routine.","We turned what we had learned from the early problems into a practical planning aid."],"options":["Everyday life became harder before it became easier, and the shared list helped us understand the new hours.","We began planning with the actual opening hours instead of making repeated unsuccessful trips.","The shared list gave us a way to fit the errands into the new routine.","We turned what we had learned from the early problems into a practical planning aid."]},"advanced-native-1850-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Everyday life became harder before it became easier, and the later improvement is already documented."],"options":["We would need more of the account before describing a completed adjustment.","Everyday life became harder before it became easier, and the later improvement is already documented.","The first two weeks are described as difficult, while the later outcome is still unknown."]},"advanced-native-1850-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["後來一定會自行改善，所以現在不用聽任何支援需要。"],"options":["可以查看困難在哪裏，以及哪些方法或幫助可能有用。","某些日常安排暫時較難。","後來一定會自行改善，所以現在不用聽任何支援需要。"]},"advanced-native-1850-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Everyday life became harder before it became easier for us because we learned the new hours and changed how we planned, not because we ignored the problem."],"options":["I would keep making the same trips and wait for the opening hours to become familiar without recording 