('advanced-native-1851', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1851-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者要離開平常見面的人，但仍有保持聯絡的意願。"],"options":["說話者決定不再回覆任何舊鄰居的聯絡。","鄰居因跟不上工作進展，被排除在新的培訓外。","說話者要離開平常見面的人，但仍有保持聯絡的意願。","說話者只改了職銜，住處和每天見面的人完全照舊。"]},"advanced-native-1851-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The ordinary encounters I valued would no longer happen in the same way.","Calling people could preserve contact, but would not be the same as seeing them in the street.","I had to recognise a change in the relationships around my everyday routine.","It meant leaving familiar people behind, including neighbours who were part of each morning."],"options":["The ordinary encounters I valued would no longer happen in the same way.","Calling people could preserve contact, but would not be the same as seeing them in the street.","I had to recognise a change in the relationships around my everyday routine.","It meant leaving familiar people behind, including neighbours who were part of each morning."]},"advanced-native-1851-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The title change alone does not establish that she is leaving familiar people behind."],"options":["The new title is a report that she has moved away from the colleagues she knows.","The account describes her replacing the old daily contacts with an unfamiliar team.","The title change alone does not establish that she is leaving familiar people behind."]},"advanced-native-1851-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["當事人已決定從此不再跟那些人聯絡。"],"options":["當事人已決定從此不再跟那些人聯絡。","仍可同時保持電話或其他來往。","日常身邊的人際接觸可能改變。"]},"advanced-native-1851-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Leaving familiar people behind can change the ordinary moments, even when I keep calling; both kinds of contact matter to me."],"options":["I thought planning calls meant the daily street encounters would remain the same.","I would compare only the number of messages, rather than what changes in the way we meet.","Leaving familiar people behind can change the ordinary moments, even when I keep calling; both kinds of contact matter to me."]},"advanced-native-1851-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Moving here meant leaving familiar people behind, but I would also like to begin getting to know this neighbourhood. Could I join one meeting first and hear what the group enjoys reading?","I have left familiar people behind in my old district, and I miss the everyday conversations. Thank you for inviting me; I would like to try the reading group while keeping those earlier connections too."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1852', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1852-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者想念熟悉招呼帶來的安心感，並非全盤否定新街道。"],"options":["說話者最在意新街道的噪音，並沒有想念店主的問候。","新街道的店主已每天叫出說話者名字，沒有差別。","說話者只在比較兩條街的租金，沒有提熟悉感。","說話者想念熟悉招呼帶來的安心感，並非全盤否定新街道。"]},"advanced-native-1852-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["A small daily recognition had become something I could rely on emotionally.","I missed that understated sense of knowing and being known, not a perfect place with no problems.","I missed the quiet comfort of being recognised in the ordinary morning routine.","The shopkeeper’s familiar greeting made the street feel reassuring."],"options":["A small daily recognition had become something I could rely on emotionally.","I missed that understated sense of knowing and being known, not a perfect place with no problems.","I missed the quiet comfort of being recognised in the ordinary morning routine.","The shopkeeper’s familiar greeting made the street feel reassuring."]},"advanced-native-1852-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The familiar jokes can offer quiet comfort even when the room is lively."],"options":["The account describes a silent meal without conversation or laughter.","The familiar jokes can offer quiet comfort even when the room is lively.","The noise establishes that the person did not find any reassurance in the breakfast."]},"advanced-native-1852-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["實際環境一定完全沒有聲音。"],"options":["實際環境一定完全沒有聲音。","可用熟悉招呼或小習慣說明感受來源。","有一種溫和而不張揚的安心感。"]},"advanced-native-1852-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The quiet comfort came from being recognised, not from judging which street looked better."],"options":["I thought missing a place mainly meant being dissatisfied with how the new buildings looked.","The quiet comfort came from being recognised, not from judging which street looked better.","I thought a pleasant appearance would give the same familiarity as years of ordinary greetings."]},"advanced-native-1852-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Could you send the poetry book with my old notes in the margins? The quiet comfort of those familiar lines would mean more to me here than a new expensive edition.","I would love the quiet comfort of reading my annotated poetry book during this unfamiliar term. If it is possible, could you post that copy rather than buy a replacement?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1853', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1853-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["搬運整理順利，卻仍缺少原有的日常陪伴。"],"options":["搬運整理順利，卻仍缺少原有的日常陪伴。","說話者主要不滿箱子放不下，沒有提人際接觸。","說話者已找到完全相同的晚間散步伙伴。","舊鄰居跟說話者一起搬進新住所，每晚仍照舊同行。"]},"advanced-native-1853-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I had not yet found a place for those small daily stories in my new routine.","Coping with the emotional gap after a move was harder than arranging the boxes.","I missed an ordinary way of sharing the day with someone familiar.","The practical jobs were done, but the usual companionship was not there."],"options":["I had not yet found a place for those small daily stories in my new routine.","Coping with the emotional gap after a move was harder than arranging the boxes.","I missed an ordinary way of sharing the day with someone familiar.","The practical jobs were done, but the usual companionship was not there."]},"advanced-native-1853-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["New contacts do not by themselves show that the emotional gap after a move has disappeared for her."],"options":["The number of new classmates is enough to establish that she no longer misses the old walks.","She has described the new classmates taking part in the same evening routine with her.","New contacts do not by themselves show that the emotional gap after a move has disappeared for her."]},"advanced-native-1853-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["當事人必定認為搬家是錯誤決定。"],"options":["當事人可能缺少熟悉的連繫。","當事人必定認為搬家是錯誤決定。","實際搬運順利與心裏想念可以並存。"]},"advanced-native-1853-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The emotional gap after a move is about the companionship I miss, not whether I have finished putting the boxes away."],"options":["I think a better storage arrangement would address the main loss I have described.","The emotional gap after a move is about the companionship I miss, not whether I have finished putting the boxes away.","I thought finishing the practical tasks meant the familiar company would already have a place in the new routine."]},"advanced-native-1853-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The emotional gap after a move is real for me, but it does not mean I wish I had rejected the new course. Could the title leave room for both missing the old conversations and valuing the choice I made?","I am describing the emotional gap after a move, not a verdict that leaving was a mistake. I would like the heading to keep my continued interest in the course alongside the familiar company I miss."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1854', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1854-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["持續參與和來往，讓小組與社區有較深互信。"],"options":["小組收到鄰居構想後，才第一次開始參與園圃工作。","持續參與和來往，讓小組與社區有較深互信。","只因地址登記已久，小組從未參與也已獲相同互信。","大家只把小組當未曾見過的外來團隊。"]},"advanced-native-1854-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We built deep roots through years of taking part and listening to neighbours.","The garden gave us repeated opportunities to work with people and hear their stories.","Trust grew through ordinary shared activity, not merely through having an address there.","People began treating us as someone to approach with ideas after that continuing involvement."],"options":["We built deep roots through years of taking part and listening to neighbours.","The garden gave us repeated opportunities to work with people and hear their stories.","Trust grew through ordinary shared activity, not merely through having an address there.","People began treating us as someone to approach with ideas after that continuing involvement."]},"advanced-native-1854-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The birthplace and address alone do not show how he has built deep roots in the community."],"options":["The birthplace and address alone do not show how he has built deep roots in the community.","The same address establishes that he regularly joins community work and is trusted with shared plans.","The account already describes the neighbours seeking him out for advice."]},"advanced-native-1854-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["沒有在這裏出生的人，就不可能建立深厚連繫。"],"options":["跟社區的連繫可能隨持續參與加深。","沒有在這裏出生的人，就不可能建立深厚連繫。","仍可具體說哪些關係及活動支撐這個比喻。"]},"advanced-native-1854-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["People can build deep roots through sustained relationships, even if their families did not start here."],"options":["I would use the age of the family address as the main test before considering any shared activity.","I thought roots meant an inherited identity that later relationships could not contribute to.","People can build deep roots through sustained relationships, even if their families did not start here."]},"advanced-native-1854-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["You can begin to build deep roots here without a local family history. If you are interested, would you like to visit the drama group and see whether helping with the story recordings feels like a way to take part?","We do not have to inherit every connection to build deep roots in a place. You could start by meeting the people collecting the recordings, with no pressure to promise a regular role before you have seen the work."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1856', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1856-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["關係、固定活動與被留意的感受，一起加深了地方的歸屬感。"],"options":["說話者只因買下物業，便沒有再參與任何日常活動。","歸屬感主要來自一次臨時派對，沒有每周重複的活動或關係。","說話者還未認識任何人，也未有固定習慣。","關係、固定活動與被留意的感受，一起加深了地方的歸屬感。"]},"advanced-native-1856-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The market visit became a familiar pattern rather than a place I passed once.","Returning mattered because people noticed me and the place felt connected with my life.","It gave me roots, rhythm, and a stronger sense of home through people, routine and being noticed.","The garden introduced me to people who became part of my ordinary week."],"options":["The market visit became a familiar pattern rather than a place I passed once.","Returning mattered because people noticed me and the place felt connected with my life.","It gave me roots, rhythm, and a stronger sense of home through people, routine and being noticed.","The garden introduced me to people who became part of my ordinary week."]},"advanced-native-1856-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Some parts of roots, rhythm, and a stronger sense of home are emerging, but her stated feeling of belonging still needs to be respected."],"options":["The regular market visit establishes that she already feels fully at home.","Feeling like a guest means she has not formed any routine or recognised any local person.","Some parts of roots, rhythm, and a stronger sense of home are emerging, but her stated feeling of belonging still needs to be respected."]},"advanced-native-1856-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["要有這些感受，就必須擁有當地物業而且永不離開。"],"options":["要有這些感受，就必須擁有當地物業而且永不離開。","仍可用個人具體經驗說明，不能只看住了多久。","關係、習慣和感受共同構成一種歸屬。"]},"advanced-native-1856-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["This place gave me roots, rhythm, and a stronger sense of home; moving does not erase what I learned to value here."],"options":["I would judge the old routines only by whether I can repeat them exactly in the new place.","This place gave me roots, rhythm, and a stronger sense of home; moving does not erase what I learned to value here.","I thought a meaningful sense of home required me to keep the same address for the rest of my life."]},"advanced-native-1856-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["You have given me roots, rhythm, and a stronger sense of home through our shared weekends and small acts of care. I hope to carry those habits into the next place while keeping a place for these friendships in my life.","The years here brought roots, rhythm, and a stronger sense of home, not just a longer list of addresses. Thank you for being part of that; I would like us to keep talking after the move, even as our routines change."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1857', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1857-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["原有習慣可帶來穩定，但不再回應需要時也可能限制參與。"],"options":["原有習慣可帶來穩定，但不再回應需要時也可能限制參與。","說話者已確定晚下班的人不想參與，所以不用再問。","說話者認為所有長期習慣都應立即取消。","聚會已改成晚間，所有人的意見也已收集完畢。"]},"advanced-native-1857-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Asking again would help us distinguish useful stability from an arrangement we repeat without thinking.","Roots can sometimes turn into ruts if we keep a routine without checking whom it now leaves out.","A time that suited the original group may not suit people who have joined since.","I value the familiar routine, but want to know whether it still enables people to take part."],"options":["Asking again would help us distinguish useful stability from an arrangement we repeat without thinking.","Roots can sometimes turn into ruts if we keep a routine without checking whom it now leaves out.","A time that suited the original group may not suit people who have joined since.","I value the familiar routine, but want to know whether it still enables people to take part."]},"advanced-native-1857-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The shop’s age alone does not show that the warning “roots can sometimes turn into ruts” applies to its present habits."],"options":["The shop’s age alone does not show that the warning “roots can sometimes turn into ruts” applies to its present habits.","Keeping the familiar greeting establishes that the shop has stopped responding to customers.","Trying new services means the shop no longer has any continuing connection with its earlier customers."]},"advanced-native-1857-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["建立深厚關係後，停滯便是無法避免的結果。"],"options":["建立深厚關係後，停滯便是無法避免的結果。","可保留有用的根基，同時檢視需要調整的習慣。","穩定的習慣若不再回應需要，可能變得限制人。"]},"advanced-native-1857-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Roots can sometimes turn into ruts; I would keep the shared stories and ask how younger members want to take part."],"options":["I would replace the shared stories first and ask about participation afterwards.","Roots can sometimes turn into ruts; I would keep the shared stories and ask how younger members want to take part.","I assumed that repeating the familiar programme was itself enough to show what younger members wanted."]},"advanced-native-1857-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Roots can sometimes turn into ruts if a family recipe book leaves no room for questions. Keep the stories, but please add notes about quantities and the adjustments you try.","These recipes connect us with earlier cooks, yet roots can sometimes turn into ruts when we treat every old instruction as untouchable. Please record what you learn as you cook, alongside the family stories."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1858', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1858-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["她想保持家人連繫，同時探索新的興趣。"],"options":["家人已全部加入同一刊物，所以她沒有接觸新方向。","她想保持家人連繫，同時探索新的興趣。","她因加入刊物，已決定不再跟家人來往。","她只選家人參與過的活動，避免任何陌生興趣。"]},"advanced-native-1858-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She wanted strong roots without becoming afraid to branch out into unfamiliar interests.","She wanted to stay in touch with her family while trying something new for herself.","Her family connections mattered, but did not need to decide every activity she joined.","She was seeking both continuity and room to develop interests of her own."],"options":["She wanted strong roots without becoming afraid to branch out into unfamiliar interests.","She wanted to stay in touch with her family while trying something new for herself.","Her family connections mattered, but did not need to decide every activity she joined.","She was seeking both continuity and room to develop interests of her own."]},"advanced-native-1858-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Her existing friendships provide roots, but her fear of trying anything new does not yet show strong roots without becoming afraid to branch out."],"options":["Her existing friendships provide roots, but her fear of trying anything new does not yet show strong roots without becoming afraid to branch out.","Declining unfamiliar interests is the part that demonstrates her willingness to explore.","Trying a new interest would itself mean she had stopped valuing her old friends."]},"advanced-native-1858-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["只有放棄原有關係，才算真正探索新方向。"],"options":["不同人可用不同活動保持連繫並發展興趣。","穩固歸屬可以跟新嘗試並存。","只有放棄原有關係，才算真正探索新方向。"]},"advanced-native-1858-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I want strong roots without becoming afraid to branch out; I can keep contributing here and learn from a different collaboration."],"options":["I would leave the original group before finding out whether the two commitments can fit together.","I want strong roots without becoming afraid to branch out; I can keep contributing here and learn from a different collaboration.","I assumed keeping a connection meant choosing only projects this group had already tried."]},"advanced-native-1858-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I want strong roots without becoming afraid to branch out, so I will begin with my grandmother’s recipe and explain the variations I try. Please introduce it as one family’s version, not as the voice of an entire culture.","For me, having strong roots without becoming afraid to branch out means respecting the recipe’s history while exploring ingredients. Could the introduction say whose family recipe this is, rather than present my choices as what everyone does?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1860', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1860-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["搬遷讓說話者開始想讀的課程，但沒有要求放棄舊友。"],"options":["搬遷讓說話者開始想讀的課程，但沒有要求放棄舊友。","說話者只是更改郵寄資料，生活安排和目標都沒有變。","說話者把搬遷當成不再需要以前朋友的理由。","課程在搬家前已修畢，所以搬近學校沒有新機會。"]},"advanced-native-1860-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I could take a new direction without treating my earlier friendships as something to discard.","It offered a fresh page rather than just a new address, because I could begin a course I had kept postponing.","Living nearer the college made a long-delayed plan practical.","The change mattered because it opened a specific opportunity in my everyday life."],"options":["I could take a new direction without treating my earlier friendships as something to discard.","It offered a fresh page rather than just a new address, because I could begin a course I had kept postponing.","Living nearer the college made a long-delayed plan practical.","The change mattered because it opened a specific opportunity in my everyday life."]},"advanced-native-1860-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["A different address alone does not establish a fresh page rather than just a new address in the person’s own experience."],"options":["A different address alone does not establish a fresh page rather than just a new address in the person’s own experience.","The new postal details show that the person has chosen to replace the earlier goals.","The person’s stated aim is to replace the old working routine, with the shorter journey only incidental."]},"advanced-native-1860-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["只要搬家，就已抹去過去的關係與經驗。"],"options":["當事人可珍惜過去，同時開始新的安排。","新階段可有具體機會作支持。","只要搬家，就已抹去過去的關係與經驗。"]},"advanced-native-1860-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It may feel like a fresh page rather than just a new address, but I would ask what new direction the person actually wants."],"options":["I thought a change in postal details was enough to tell us that the person wanted different goals.","I would describe it as a fresh start before hearing why the person chose to move.","It may feel like a fresh page rather than just a new address, but I would ask what new direction the person actually wants."]},"advanced-native-1860-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Hosting our first family meal made the move feel like a fresh page rather than just a new address. I was beginning to welcome people in my own way, while the familiar stories still belonged at the table.","This meal marked a fresh page rather than just a new address: for once, I planned the welcome instead of following someone else’s arrangements. The old family connections were part of the beginning, not something I had left out."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1861', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1861-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["原先答應的支持突然撤回，令小組的安排失去依靠。"],"options":["房間從未答應提供，小組只是曾經問過。","小組早已知道取消安排，並已完成其他場地的排練。","說話者只是在說排練內容太難，沒有提場地承諾。","原先答應的支持突然撤回，令小組的安排失去依靠。"]},"advanced-native-1861-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The support they had planned around disappeared just before they needed it.","The problem was the unexpected withdrawal, not simply a preference for a different room.","It pulled the rug out from under them because they had built the rehearsal plan around a promised room.","They had relied on the room being available and had almost no warning to arrange an alternative."],"options":["The support they had planned around disappeared just before they needed it.","The problem was the unexpected withdrawal, not simply a preference for a different room.","It pulled the rug out from under them because they had built the rehearsal plan around a promised room.","They had relied on the room being available and had almost no warning to arrange an alternative."]},"advanced-native-1861-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["A planned change with continuing support does not by itself show that the venue pulled the rug out from under them."],"options":["The different room number establishes an unexpected loss of the support the group depended on.","Accepting an alternative means the group had never relied on the original arrangement.","A planned change with continuing support does not by itself show that the venue pulled the rug out from under them."]},"advanced-native-1861-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["撤回支持的人一定蓄意使對方失敗。"],"options":["有人突然失去原先依靠的支持。","撤回支持的人一定蓄意使對方失敗。","當事人可能需要重新安排，但結果仍未確定。"]},"advanced-native-1861-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["They may find another room, but the sudden cancellation still pulled the rug out from under them at a crucial point."],"options":["I would wait for the final venue to be found before recognising any disruption to the preparation.","They may find another room, but the sudden cancellation still pulled the rug out from under them at a crucial point.","I assumed having any possible alternative meant the original promise had not mattered to their plan."]},"advanced-native-1861-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Ending the agreed storage tomorrow would pull the rug out from under us before our new storage space is ready. Could we collect the urgent boxes first and agree three more days for the rest?","The sudden end to the storage arrangement has pulled the rug out from under us, so I would like to agree a staged collection. We can take the urgent boxes tomorrow; could the remaining boxes stay for three days while we prepare the new storage space?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1862', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1862-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["頻繁換臨時住處，令普通工作日常難以安頓。"],"options":["說話者確定下一處工作空間，已把筆記本放好不用再搬。","他們只是把工作改成全用電子筆記，沒有提住處變化。","頻繁換臨時住處，令普通工作日常難以安頓。","他們已固定住在同一房間多年，只偶爾整理筆記。"]},"advanced-native-1862-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Each temporary room meant finding somewhere different to set up the notebook again.","I could not settle the small arrangements that usually make everyday work predictable.","The repeated moves kept interrupting our sense of having a regular base.","We were living out of a suitcase, moving between temporary rooms without an ordinary work routine."],"options":["Each temporary room meant finding somewhere different to set up the notebook again.","I could not settle the small arrangements that usually make everyday work predictable.","The repeated moves kept interrupting our sense of having a regular base.","We were living out of a suitcase, moving between temporary rooms without an ordinary work routine."]},"advanced-native-1862-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Keeping a home elsewhere does not prevent her from living out of a suitcase during this unsettled period of work travel."],"options":["Repeated temporary stays show only that she enjoys travel, not that her routines are interrupted.","Keeping a home elsewhere does not prevent her from living out of a suitcase during this unsettled period of work travel.","Owning or keeping a home elsewhere establishes that her present daily routine is already settled."]},"advanced-native-1862-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["當事人在任何地方都不可能有自己的家。"],"options":["當事人在任何地方都不可能有自己的家。","可以描述有原有家卻長期輾轉出差的狀態。","當事人一段時間可能難以建立固定日常。"]},"advanced-native-1862-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I still have a home, but I have been living out of a suitcase between placements, with little chance to establish a routine."],"options":["I would describe the whole period only by whether the temporary rooms were pleasant.","I still have a home, but I have been living out of a suitcase between placements, with little chance to establish a routine.","I assumed keeping the home meant I would have the same daily arrangements while staying elsewhere."]},"advanced-native-1862-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I have been living out of a suitcase for weeks, so I need to stay in one place this time. I cannot take the travelling role, but I could organise the registration records remotely.","After weeks of living out of a suitcase, I would like a more settled base for the next fortnight. Could I help with the registration records from here instead of joining this trip?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1863', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1863-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["起初確有興奮，重複的匆忙生活後感受開始減弱。"],"options":["每晚匆忙入住，令說話者比初時更興奮。","起初確有興奮，重複的匆忙生活後感受開始減弱。","說話者從未對工作感到興奮，只是假裝喜歡。","說話者已正式辭職，這裏主要在報告離職程序。"]},"advanced-native-1863-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The excitement began to wear thin when the evenings became a repeated rush between places.","I enjoyed the first month, but later wanted more ordinary time with people.","The novelty mattered less as the hurried routine became more noticeable.","I was still doing the job, but no longer felt the same enthusiasm about the travel."],"options":["The excitement began to wear thin when the evenings became a repeated rush between places.","I enjoyed the first month, but later wanted more ordinary time with people.","The novelty mattered less as the hurried routine became more noticeable.","I was still doing the job, but no longer felt the same enthusiasm about the travel."]},"advanced-native-1863-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The explanation is starting to wear thin, though the decision about the activity is still open."],"options":["The activity has already been cancelled because nobody ever accepted the explanation.","Repeating the explanation shows that members find it more convincing each time.","The explanation is starting to wear thin, though the decision about the activity is still open."]},"advanced-native-1863-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["當事人從來沒有真心期待過這件事。"],"options":["仍可另外討論是否繼續及怎樣調整。","原有熱情可能已不如從前。","當事人從來沒有真心期待過這件事。"]},"advanced-native-1863-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The excitement can wear thin without the earlier enjoyment being false; I liked the novelty, but now notice the cost of the rushed routine."],"options":["I assumed a genuine interest would feel exactly the same after months of repetition.","I would describe my first month only by how tired I feel about the routine now.","The excitement can wear thin without the earlier enjoyment being false; I liked the novelty, but now notice the cost of the rushed routine."]},"advanced-native-1863-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The excitement of opening the box has worn thin as the contents have become repetitive. Before I renew, could you tell me what will be different in the next season?","I enjoyed the early boxes, but the novelty is starting to wear thin. Could you explain the changes planned for the next season so I can decide whether the subscription still suits me?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1864', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1864-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["他們想從反覆短住轉向較穩定的生活與連繫。"],"options":["他們想從反覆短住轉向較穩定的生活與連繫。","他們只打算留一晚，沒有考慮之後生活。","他們認為要先在當地出生，才有資格參與。","他們已承諾終身不搬走，才開始每周活動。"]},"advanced-native-1864-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They hope to become part of the town’s everyday life rather than treat it only as a temporary stop.","They want to put down roots and begin building a stable life in the town.","They would like ordinary weekly connections instead of planning around another immediate move.","Their next plans are about staying involved locally for a while."],"options":["They hope to become part of the town’s everyday life rather than treat it only as a temporary stop.","They want to put down roots and begin building a stable life in the town.","They would like ordinary weekly connections instead of planning around another immediate move.","Their next plans are about staying involved locally for a while."]},"advanced-native-1864-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["A two-night work stop alone does not show a plan to put down roots there."],"options":["The visitor has described seeking a continuing local role rather than returning to the existing life after the work stop.","A two-night work stop alone does not show a plan to put down roots there.","Any stay in the town establishes a decision to build a continuing life there."]},"advanced-native-1864-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["必須先擁有當地物業，才可以安頓。"],"options":["開始跟地方建立較持續的生活安排。","必須先擁有當地物業，才可以安頓。","可逐步參加當地的日常活動。"]},"advanced-native-1864-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I can put down roots through continuing relationships and ordinary routines; owning the building is a separate question."],"options":["I assumed the housing ownership label told us whether someone wanted continuing local connections.","I would wait to discuss community activities until I knew whether I would ever buy the flat.","I can put down roots through continuing relationships and ordinary routines; owning the building is a separate question."]},"advanced-native-1864-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I would like to put down roots in this neighbourhood, and the garden could be part of that. Before I commit to a plot, could you explain the weekly care and the arrangements when someone is away?","We are hoping to put down roots here, so we are interested in caring for a plot through the season. Could we discuss the rota first to make sure we can offer the regular help it needs?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1865', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1865-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["她對難以預計的外在費用缺乏控制，想先了解資訊。"],"options":["她已收到下次續租確切金額，現在只是比較付款日期。","她已決定離開，並已完成下一份租約。","她確定每次加租的動機都是針對自己。","她對難以預計的外在費用缺乏控制，想先了解資訊。"]},"advanced-native-1865-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She wanted to understand an outside cost that could affect her plans.","She did not yet have the information she needed to compare the available arrangements.","She felt at the mercy of rent increases because she could not predict the renewal cost.","The uncertainty made it difficult to plan her next period there."],"options":["She wanted to understand an outside cost that could affect her plans.","She did not yet have the information she needed to compare the available arrangements.","She felt at the mercy of rent increases because she could not predict the renewal cost.","The uncertainty made it difficult to plan her next period there."]},"advanced-native-1865-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The stated concern is travel time, so this account does not establish that she is at the mercy of rent increases this year."],"options":["The stated concern is travel time, so this account does not establish that she is at the mercy of rent increases this year.","Worry about the journey establishes that an unpredictable rent rise is the immediate problem.","A fixed rent for this year tells us that every other part of her housing situation is secure."]},"advanced-native-1865-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["已能確立業主的法律權限及每次加租是否合法。"],"options":["已能確立業主的法律權限及每次加租是否合法。","仍需了解實際安排，才能知道有哪些選擇。","人物感到自己的計劃易受外在費用影響。"]},"advanced-native-1865-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["She can ask for information and still feel at the mercy of rent increases; asking does not mean she controls the next figure."],"options":["I would treat her worry as a confirmed account of the landlord’s intentions.","She can ask for information and still feel at the mercy of rent increases; asking does not mean she controls the next figure.","I assumed that receiving the next figure would make later renewals predictable as well."]},"advanced-native-1865-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Please keep ‘she felt at the mercy of rent increases’ as her own description, rather than turn it into a statement that every tenant has no choices. The paragraph should also retain the questions she asked about the proposal.","Could we restore the words ‘felt at the mercy of rent increases’ in the quotation and keep the account of her enquiries? That would preserve her perspective without making the broader claim added by the draft."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
