’s pocket, but that feeling alone does not compare the options for each person."],"options":["I understand why rent can feel like money disappearing into someone else’s pocket, but that feeling alone does not compare the options for each person.","I thought not gaining ownership meant the payment had supplied no useful accommodation.","I would use that image as the whole comparison before asking what the person needs."]},"advanced-native-1866-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I understand why rent may feel like money disappearing into someone else’s pocket, but I am also paying for somewhere to live while keeping the exchange opportunity open. I want to compare the arrangements against my present needs, not decide from that image alone.","Money disappearing into someone else’s pocket captures one frustration about renting, but it does not describe everything I need this year. A place to stay and flexibility for the exchange both matter to my decision."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1868', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1868-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者保留下一步選擇，但仍需完成現有責任。"],"options":["說話者保留下一步選擇，但仍需完成現有責任。","她把短期安排當成不用履行任何已答應工時。","她已決定終身留在同一職位，不再了解其他工作。","她的下一處申請已獲批，現有安排已結束。"]},"advanced-native-1868-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The arrangement preserved some choice without removing my present responsibilities.","It let me keep my feet light while finding out which archive work suited me.","I could learn about the work before making a longer commitment.","I had room to consider the next application while completing the agreed hours."],"options":["The arrangement preserved some choice without removing my present responsibilities.","It let me keep my feet light while finding out which archive work suited me.","I could learn about the work before making a longer commitment.","I had room to consider the next application while completing the agreed hours."]},"advanced-native-1868-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The temporary label does not by itself help her keep her feet light if the agreed dates still create a year-long conflict."],"options":["Calling the role temporary means the agreed weekly dates no longer need to be discussed.","Considering the course means she has already told the group which dates she cannot attend.","The temporary label does not by itself help her keep her feet light if the agreed dates still create a year-long conflict."]},"advanced-native-1868-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["已答應的責任可不告知別人便擱下。"],"options":["短承諾也可能有需要完成的安排。","保留下一步調整空間。","已答應的責任可不告知別人便擱下。"]},"advanced-native-1868-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I want to keep my feet light, so I would check the dates and responsibilities before accepting another role."],"options":["I would compare only how interesting the invitations sound, not whether the commitments fit.","I want to keep my feet light, so I would check the dates and responsibilities before accepting another role.","I thought flexibility meant leaving the dates unclear until both groups had planned around me."]},"advanced-native-1868-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Thank you for the generous offer, but I want to keep my feet light while my next base is uncertain. A portable tool case would help more than a fixed worktable, because I could use it at shared desks in different places.","I would like to keep my feet light for the coming months rather than plan my moves around a large table. Could we choose a tool case I can carry instead, while I use the shared workspaces available along the way?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1869', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1869-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["小組找不同資料來源，減少只靠一個邀請的依賴，但未保證獲回覆。"],"options":["小組已取得兩邊同意，現在只在安排印刷。","小組把同一封未回覆邀請改了標題，沒有接觸其他來源。","小組決定不再認真準備主要訪問，因為有另一封查詢。","小組找不同資料來源，減少只靠一個邀請的依賴，但未保證獲回覆。"]},"advanced-native-1869-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["A separate archive could reduce their dependence on one person’s availability.","They were looking for an additional source without assuming either would agree.","They did not want to have all their eggs in one basket by relying on a single interview request.","They wanted another possible route to information if the main request was declined."],"options":["A separate archive could reduce their dependence on one person’s availability.","They were looking for an additional source without assuming either would agree.","They did not want to have all their eggs in one basket by relying on a single interview request.","They wanted another possible route to information if the main request was declined."]},"advanced-native-1869-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Different formats do not remove the fact that they have all their eggs in one basket if every plan depends on the same unconfirmed interview."],"options":["Depending on one interview means the interview is already certain to be refused.","Different formats do not remove the fact that they have all their eggs in one basket if every plan depends on the same unconfirmed interview.","Three formats establish three independent sources of agreement."]},"advanced-native-1869-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["只要有多個可能途徑，便無需認真準備其中任何一個。"],"options":["不要只依賴單一計劃或來源。","只要有多個可能途徑，便無需認真準備其中任何一個。","另有途徑也仍可能有不確定性。"]},"advanced-native-1869-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We should not have all our eggs in one basket, but we should still prepare the main interview properly while the other request is pending."],"options":["We should not have all our eggs in one basket, but we should still prepare the main interview properly while the other request is pending.","I thought another unanswered request meant we no longer needed questions for the main interview.","I would count the two requests as two confirmed sources before either has replied."]},"advanced-native-1869-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["We should not have all our eggs in one basket by relying on one connected computer for the celebration. Let’s test an offline copy on a second device before the day.","I do not want us to have all our eggs in one basket if the computer loses its connection. Could we prepare a tested offline copy and check that another device can play it?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1870', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1870-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者尚未接受，想了解期限後再比較課程安排。"],"options":["說話者已向兩個課程承諾一定出席。","兩個課程已保證永久為說話者保留位置。","說話者已放棄其中一個課程，現在只查詢教材。","說話者尚未接受，想了解期限後再比較課程安排。"]},"advanced-native-1870-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The other timetable might affect my choice, so I was not ready to accept a place.","I wanted a clear date for deciding rather than leave my answer indefinitely uncertain.","I wanted to keep my options open until I could compare the course timetables.","I needed to know how long I could consider both courses without misleading either organiser."],"options":["The other timetable might affect my choice, so I was not ready to accept a place.","I wanted a clear date for deciding rather than leave my answer indefinitely uncertain.","I wanted to keep my options open until I could compare the course timetables.","I needed to know how long I could consider both courses without misleading either organiser."]},"advanced-native-1870-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Keeping her options open would require being clear that she has not committed; promising both has already created conflicting expectations."],"options":["Promising both is the same as telling both organisers that no decision has been made.","A timetable clash shows that neither invitation was ever a genuine opportunity.","Keeping her options open would require being clear that she has not committed; promising both has already created conflicting expectations."]},"advanced-native-1870-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["所有選項會自動一直等到自己想答覆時。"],"options":["尚未作出排除其他選擇的定案。","所有選項會自動一直等到自己想答覆時。","仍需要知道決定期限與對方安排。"]},"advanced-native-1870-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I would like to keep my options open, so I will ask the deadline and give a clear answer by then."],"options":["I would like to keep my options open, so I will ask the deadline and give a clear answer by then.","I assumed silence would tell the organiser exactly how long I needed to decide.","I would accept the place now and describe it as undecided only if a better offer arrives."]},"advanced-native-1870-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Could we keep our options open between Thursday afternoon and Saturday afternoon until I receive the catch-up class dates? I will confirm by Wednesday, and I understand if you need to make other plans sooner.","I would like to keep my options open for those two afternoons until Wednesday rather than promise both. Please tell me if that is too late for your plans, and we can choose another way to meet."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1871', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1871-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["長期固定地點的責任可能限制下一步移動，因此要先討論承諾範圍。"],"options":["長期固定地點的責任可能限制下一步移動，因此要先討論承諾範圍。","說話者已接下一年職責，現在宣布不通知就離開。","工作坊已確認可隨時遠端完成，所以沒有地點限制。","說話者認為每種短期責任都必定比長期更差。"]},"advanced-native-1871-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["A shorter role might let me contribute without promising to remain at one site for the whole year.","A year at one workshop could tie me down before I know where the field placement will be.","The location of my next placement is uncertain, so a fixed year could create a conflict.","I want the commitment to fit what I can realistically promise."],"options":["A shorter role might let me contribute without promising to remain at one site for the whole year.","A year at one workshop could tie me down before I know where the field placement will be.","The location of my next placement is uncertain, so a fixed year could create a conflict.","I want the commitment to fit what I can realistically promise."]},"advanced-native-1871-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["We need to know what freedom the task would restrict before saying it would tie her down."],"options":["We need to know what freedom the task would restrict before saying it would tie her down.","Having any responsibility establishes that she must remain in the same city for a year.","A flexible task means she will have no agreed work to complete."]},"advanced-native-1871-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["任何已答應的工作都可不通知便自行離開。"],"options":["可在答應前商量責任範圍或時間。","某承諾可能限制我的下一步選擇。","任何已答應的工作都可不通知便自行離開。"]},"advanced-native-1871-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["If it would tie me down beyond what I can promise, I should discuss a shorter commitment before accepting."],"options":["I would compare the title of the role rather than the dates and location it requires.","If it would tie me down beyond what I can promise, I should discuss a shorter commitment before accepting.","I thought saying yes now would leave the group’s expectations unchanged if I left early later."]},"advanced-native-1871-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I love spending time with your dog, but taking on one of my own would tie me down to daily care I cannot reliably provide during the study trip. I can still help with walks while I am here, without making an adoption promise.","Adopting a dog now could tie me down in a way that conflicts with the long trip I have planned. I would rather offer help with your dog while I am in town than promise care I cannot sustain."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1872', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1872-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["同一時段有三項需要分配注意力的工作。"],"options":["說話者已證明每項工作都完成得毫無錯漏。","同一時段有三項需要分配注意力的工作。","三項工作分別在三個月完成，從不重疊。","三項工作已由別人完全接手，說話者沒有兼顧。"]},"advanced-native-1872-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I had to juggle three things at once, with guests, captions and volunteers all needing attention.","Several kinds of work competed for my attention during the same hour.","I needed to move between welcoming people, checking text and guiding the helpers.","The tasks overlapped rather than waiting neatly for one another to finish."],"options":["I had to juggle three things at once, with guests, captions and volunteers all needing attention.","Several kinds of work competed for my attention during the same hour.","I needed to move between welcoming people, checking text and guiding the helpers.","The tasks overlapped rather than waiting neatly for one another to finish."]},"advanced-native-1872-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She needs to juggle three things at once and is still working out how to share the demands."],"options":["Naming three demands establishes that she has already balanced them successfully.","She needs to juggle three things at once and is still working out how to share the demands.","The responsibilities can be handled one after another this week without any overlap to negotiate."]},"advanced-native-1872-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["每項需要都已獲完美處理，不會有取捨。"],"options":["可以再交代優先次序、分工或需要的協助。","同時有多項需要爭取注意或資源。","每項需要都已獲完美處理，不會有取捨。"]},"advanced-native-1872-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I need to juggle three things at once, but naming them does not settle which tasks someone else can take."],"options":["I need to juggle three things at once, but naming them does not settle which tasks someone else can take.","I read the list as a sequence: finish all the guest questions, then check the captions, and only after that guide the volunteers.","I would judge the work