('advanced-native-1874', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1874-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者強烈覺得大型展位相對預算很貴，仍在查詢另一方案。"],"options":["說話者已確定收費違法，正在報告調查結果。","小組已選定大型展位，查較簡單方案只是為其他活動留備案。","較簡單方案報價已低於預算，小組已確認選用。","說話者強烈覺得大型展位相對預算很貴，仍在查詢另一方案。"]},"advanced-native-1874-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They wanted to compare a less elaborate option before committing that much money.","Their budget made the larger display difficult to justify without checking alternatives.","The larger stand came with an eye-watering fee relative to their event budget.","The price of the bigger option was far higher than they had planned for."],"options":["They wanted to compare a less elaborate option before committing that much money.","Their budget made the larger display difficult to justify without checking alternatives.","The larger stand came with an eye-watering fee relative to their event budget.","The price of the bigger option was far higher than they had planned for."]},"advanced-native-1874-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The writer presents the price as shockingly high, but the word alone does not give the amount or prove that everyone is unable to pay."],"options":["The writer presents the price as shockingly high, but the word alone does not give the amount or prove that everyone is unable to pay.","The adjective establishes that nobody in the audience can afford the ticket.","Using a strong price adjective means the writer has already checked how the fee was calculated."]},"advanced-native-1874-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["確切金額及每位讀者能否負擔。"],"options":["說話者認為費用高得驚人。","確切金額及每位讀者能否負擔。","這個字比單說 expensive 語氣更強烈。"]},"advanced-native-1874-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Eye-watering tells us the writer found the price extremely high; we would need other evidence before making a claim about dishonesty."],"options":["Eye-watering tells us the writer found the price extremely high; we would need other evidence before making a claim about dishonesty.","I 