('advanced-native-1877', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1877-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者想以具體生活準備補足年齡數字不能回答的事。"],"options":["共同帳單將完全由別人處理，說話者不打算參與。","說話者已比較完日常責任，現在只等確認搬遷日期。","說話者想以具體生活準備補足年齡數字不能回答的事。","說話者已決定按生日搬走，實際作息留待之後再談。"]},"advanced-native-1877-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I needed to think about what the move would require in an ordinary week.","The birthday marked time, but did not answer the practical questions I had.","My readiness needed to be discussed through routines and responsibilities, not assumed from age alone.","A number on the calendar did not tell me whether I was ready for those daily responsibilities."],"options":["I needed to think about what the move would require in an ordinary week.","The birthday marked time, but did not answer the practical questions I had.","My readiness needed to be discussed through routines and responsibilities, not assumed from age alone.","A number on the calendar did not tell me whether I was ready for those daily responsibilities."]},"advanced-native-1877-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["A number on the calendar does not establish equal readiness when the two people describe different preparation."],"options":["A number on the calendar does not establish equal readiness when the two people describe different preparation.","Sharing a birthday establishes that they have already practised the same daily responsibilities.","The second person has already reported completing the same preparation as the first."]},"advanced-native-1877-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["所有日期與年齡資訊，在任何安排裏都沒有用途。"],"options":["這個決定需要考慮具體準備，不只看年齡。","所有日期與年齡資訊，在任何安排裏都沒有用途。","同齡的人可以有不同需要與經驗。"]},"advanced-native-1877-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I do not want a number on the calendar to stand in for a discussion of what I can manage and what I still need to practise."],"options":["I would use my cousin’s plan as my answer before considering how my own week would work.","I do not want a number on the calendar to stand in for a discussion of what I can manage and what I still need to practise.","I thought matching ages meant our experience of daily responsibilities must match as well."]},"advanced-native-1877-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["A number on the calendar should not stand in for asking whether someone wants to play a solo and has prepared it. Could we discuss practice and preferences before assigning the sharing slots?","Rather than judge readiness by a number on the calendar alone, I would ask each player about the piece they have practised. Some may prefer a group performance first, and that should be part of the discussion."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1878', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1878-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["有一項具體進展，但還有需要練習的情況。"],"options":["她已完成所有獨立生活準備，再沒有下一步。","家人只因一周安排很忙，就說巴士規劃已完成。","她尚未參與規劃，所有路線仍由家人代做。","有一項具體進展，但還有需要練習的情況。"]},"advanced-native-1878-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They could point to a practical change rather than only an intention.","There was progress towards the goal without a claim that every preparation was complete.","Her own journey planning gave them a sense of forward movement, though some situations still needed practice.","She had taken responsibility for one concrete part of an ordinary journey."],"options":["They could point to a practical change rather than only an intention.","There was progress towards the goal without a claim that every preparation was complete.","Her own journey planning gave them a sense of forward movement, though some situations still needed practice.","She had taken responsibility for one concrete part of an ordinary journey."]},"advanced-native-1878-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Meetings alone do not establish a sense of forward movement towards fewer errors; we need evidence of a relevant change."],"options":["The current record already describes a test showing fewer input errors.","Meetings alone do not establish a sense of forward movement towards fewer errors; we need evidence of a relevant change.","More meetings establish that the form has already produced fewer errors."]},"advanced-native-1878-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["目標已經全部完成，毋須再評估下一步。"],"options":["感到正朝已說明的目標推進。","目標已經全部完成，毋須再評估下一步。","仍可有未解問題及後續測試。"]},"advanced-native-1878-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["There is a sense of forward movement because I can plan the route now, while the missed-connection practice is still a next step."],"options":["I assumed that planning the route meant I could already handle a missed connection without practice.","There is a sense of forward movement because I can plan the route now, while t