iscuss what each person needs before filling the room."]},"advanced-native-1880-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Calling the market a blank canvas overlooks the traders and routines already there. Could the feature begin with their accounts before discussing what new designs might add?","The market is not simply a blank canvas for the redevelopment team; it is already part of people’s working lives. I would interview the traders first and revise the title to acknowledge that continuing history."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1882', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1882-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者能卸下表現自信的壓力，但事情未必已解決。"],"options":["說話者能卸下表現自信的壓力，但事情未必已解決。","說話者認為要先完成明天的工作，才可談今天的難處。","說話者在廚房仍必須假裝事情順利，不能承認困難。","說話者只在比較房間面積，沒有說相處感受。"]},"advanced-native-1882-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The problem may remain, but I feel less pressure to hide how the day went.","It is where I exhale because I do not have to make the day sound better than it was.","I can admit a difficulty without pretending to have a confident answer.","The conversation gives me room to be tired rather than keep performing confidence."],"options":["The problem may remain, but I feel less pressure to hide how the day went.","It is where I exhale because I do not have to make the day sound better than it was.","I can admit a difficulty without pretending to have a confident answer.","The conversation gives me room to be tired rather than keep performing confidence."]},"advanced-native-1882-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Calling it “where you exhale” needs more than decoration; her own account describes continued pressure."],"options":["Calling it “where you exhale” needs more than decoration; her own account describes continued pressure.","An attractive room establishes that she feels free to admit difficulties there.","Her account describes feeling able to admit difficulties, rather than remaining guarded."]},"advanced-native-1882-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["所有人只要進入同一地方，就會有相同感受。"],"options":["所有人只要進入同一地方，就會有相同感受。","仍可有明天要處理的具體問題。","本人覺得那裏可卸下一些壓力。"]},"advanced-native-1882-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["This is where I exhale because I can stop pretending for a while, not because tomorrow’s work has disappeared."],"options":["I would describe the room only by whether it changes my deadline, not by how I can speak there.","This is where I exhale because I can stop pretending for a while, not because tomorrow’s work has disappeared.","I assumed this sense of ease meant I could postpone planning for tomorrow, rather than simply talk more honestly about the problem."]},"advanced-native-1882-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The riverside path is where I exhale after a crowded week, and I would be glad of your company there. Would you like a quiet walk with no need to discuss the exhibition, or would you prefer some time on your own?","For me, that path is where I exhale without having to explain how the week went. If it would suit you, we could walk there together; I will leave the choice of talking or silence to you."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
