nly outline was the measure of usefulness, so I had not considered what members gained from the new exchanges.","I would assess the new conversation only by whether the editor predicted it in advance."]},"advanced-native-1883-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The garden event took on a life of its own when neighbours used its name for seed swaps and storytelling evenings. Those gatherings grew from their ideas, not a programme I had designed for them.","What began as a temporary name has taken on a life of its own through the neighbours’ gatherings. I suggested the first title, but the continuing traditions belong to the people who kept finding new uses for it."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
