d.","I would compare only the new shift, not the daytime work it overlaps with.","The extra duties are stretching them to breaking point; we should discuss the combined load before reading the request as a lack of commitment."]},"advanced-native-1889-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The care duties and apprenticeship deadline may be stretching them to breaking point, rather than the unanswered letters simply showing laziness. I would read that delay alongside the overlapping demands described in the chapter.","Before calling the sisters lazy, we should consider whether those simultaneous duties are stretching them to breaking point. The chapter gives us evidence of a heavy load, even if it does not settle every question about their choices."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1890', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1890-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["有暫時住處，但擠迫及溫習需要仍未解決。"],"options":["維修已完成，他們正介紹自己長期固定的新家。","有暫時住處，但擠迫及溫習需要仍未解決。","房間已提供寬敞安靜書房，沒有其他需要。","房間已成為永久安排，他們不再等待原居所的維修。"]},"advanced-native-1890-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It gave them a roof over their heads, but not the quiet study space they still needed.","They had somewhere to stay, although the crowded room did not meet every daily need.","The immediate accommodation need was met, while the study arrangement remained unresolved.","The room offered temporary shelter rather than a complete long-term solution."],"options":["It gave them a roof over their heads, but not the quiet study space they still needed.","They had somewhere to stay, although the crowded room did not meet every daily need.","The immediate accommodation need was met, while the study arrangement remained unresolved.","The room offered temporary shelter rather than a complete long-term solution."]},"advanced-native-1890-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["A rented room can provide a roof over her head, even if she does not own it and still needs a desk."],"options":["Having somewhere to stay establishes that the desk problem has already been solved.","A rented room can provide a roof over her head, even if she does not own it and still needs a desk.","The description is about securing ownership rather than meeting an immediate accommodation need."]},"advanced-native-1890-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["已確定有足夠安靜的溫習空間，毋須另找地方。"],"options":["可以另外討論目前仍缺哪些需要。","他們已有基本住宿。","已確定有足夠安靜的溫習空間，毋須另找地方。"]},"advanced-native-1890-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["A roof over their heads matters, but they can be grateful for shelter and still need somewhere to study."],"options":["I would judge the room only by its availability, without asking what the family needs to do there.","A roof over their heads matters, but they can be grateful for shelter and still need somewhere to study.","I t