('advanced-native-1897', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1897-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["多年後仍有具體習慣，支持低調而深遠的影響。"],"options":["多年後仍有具體習慣，支持低調而深遠的影響。","說話者只知道導師聲音小，沒有提後來作用。","這個提問是最近才從新同事學來，與昔日導師無關。","說話者已放棄那個提問習慣，現在只談紀念活動規模。"]},"advanced-native-1897-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I can point to a continuing effect in how I approach the work.","The influence is not loud, but it runs deep in the question I still ask before telling a group’s history.","Years later, I still check whose account might be missing.","The advice became part of an ordinary habit rather than only a remembered speech."],"options":["I can point to a continuing effect in how I approach the work.","The influence is not loud, but it runs deep in the question I still ask before telling a group’s history.","Years later, I still check whose account might be missing.","The advice became part of an ordinary habit rather than only a remembered speech."]},"advanced-native-1897-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Saying the influence is not loud, but it runs deep needs evidence of an effect, not just the person’s low public profile."],"options":["Saying the influence is not loud, but it runs deep needs evidence of an effect, not just the person’s low public profile.","The account describes private advice that colleagues have continued using for years.","The low public profile is evidence that the person’s ideas now matter less in other people’s decisions."]},"advanced-native-1897-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["每個低調的人都必定對旁人有良好而深遠的影響。"],"options":["可用日後習慣或想法顯示影響。","影響可不引人注目而仍持續。","每個低調的人都必定對旁人有良好而深遠的影響。"]},"advanced-native-1897-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The influence is not loud, but it runs deep; I still use his question about missing voices, which is why he belongs in my account."],"options":["I would choose only well-known names before checking who actually changed the way I work.","The influence is not loud, but it runs deep; I still use his question about missing voices, which is why he belongs in my account.","I thought the number of public appearances was enough to measure the effect of his advice on my work."]},"advanced-native-1897-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The influence is not loud, but it runs deep in the way Mina withdraws even a reasonable request for help. The repeated family phrase offers one explanation for that hesitation, rather than a complete account of every choice she makes.","In this part of the novel, the influence is not loud, but it runs deep: Mina hears an ordinary request as a possible burden on others. I would discuss that learned expectation alongside the situation she faces, not treat her reluctance as simply her nature."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb)
